er listed above and including the catalog record \n (&quot;About This Item&quot;) with your request.\n </p>\n</li>\n\n<li><strong>If there is no information listed in the Reproduction Number field \nabove:</strong> You can generally purchase a quality copy through \nDuplication Services. Cite the Call Number listed above and include the catalog record (&quot;About This Item&quot;) with \n your request.\n</li>\n</ol>\n</p>\n\n<p> \nPrice lists, contact information, and order forms are available on the\n <a href=\"//lcweb.loc.gov/preserv/pds/\">Duplication Services Web site</a>.  \n</p>\n\n\n\n", "resource": {"caption": "digital file from original", "image": "https://tile.loc.gov/storage-services/service/pnp/det/4a00000/4a08000/4a08000/4a08065_150px.jpg", "segment_count": 1, "url": "https://www.loc.gov/resource/det.4a08065/"}, "resources": [{"caption": "digital file from original", "image": "https://tile.loc.gov/storage-services/service/pnp/det/4a00000/4a08000/4a08000/4a08065_150px.jpg", "segment_count": 1, "url": "https://www.loc.gov/resource/det.4a08065/"}], "thesaurus_entry": null, "timestamp": 1792638095245, "type": "legacyzoom", "unrestricted": true, "views": {"brief": "https://www.loc.gov/resource/det.4a08065/?fo=json&st=brief", "current": "single", "epub": "https://www.loc.gov/resource/det.4a08065/?fo=json&st=pdf", "gallery": "https://www.loc.gov/resource/det.4a08065/?fo=json&st=gallery", "grid": "https://www.loc.gov/resource/det.4a08065/?fo=json&st=grid", "image": "https://www.loc.gov/resource/det.4a08065/?fo=json&st=image", "list": "https://www.loc.gov/resource/det.4a08065/?fo=json&st=list", "pdf": "https://www.loc.gov/resource/det.4a08065/?fo=json&st=pdf", "single": "https://www.loc.gov/resource/det.4a08065/?fo=json", "slideshow": "https://www.loc.gov/resource/det.4a08065/?fo=json&st=slideshow", "text": "https://www.loc.gov/resource/det.4a08065/?fo=json&st=text"}}
